{
  "name": "Acolyte of Nature",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn one druid cantrip of your choice. This cantrip doesn't count against the number of cleric cantrips you know. You also gain Proficiency in one of the following skills of your choice: Animal Handling, Nature, or Survival.</p><p>Additionally, whenever you gain access to a new spell level of your domain spells, including at this level, you can exchange one domain spell from that spell level for another spell from the druid spell list.</p>",
